{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n0",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Red and near-infrared light are often discussed together. The combination can sound like a guarantee of better results, but a useful decision starts with the goal, the equipment and the evidence for that particular use.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s1",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n1",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "1. What do red and near-infrared mean?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s2",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n2",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "They refer to different wavelength regions. Red light is visible; near-infrared is outside the visible red range. A wavelength label is one equipment characteristic, not a promise about a health outcome.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s3",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n3",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "2. Is a combination always better?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s4",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n4",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "No universal advantage is established. In one controlled skin study, the broader light spectrum did not outperform red-only light. More wavelengths do not automatically mean a better result.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s5",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n5",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "3. What is the goal?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s6",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n6",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Skin appearance, exercise recovery and relaxation are different goals. A study about one should not be presented as evidence for all three.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s7",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n7",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "4. What does the skin research support?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s8",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n8",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Some controlled research has reported improvements in skin appearance under specific treatment conditions. That is a useful research direction, rather than a guarantee that a session reverses aging or eliminates wrinkles.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s9",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n9",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "5. What about exercise recovery?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s10",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n10",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Small trials have explored light-based treatment around exercise, with results that vary by dose and outcome. A laboratory laser protocol cannot be copied into a general LED-panel schedule without supporting evidence.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s11",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n11",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "6. Does hair research apply to any panel?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s12",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n12",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Hair studies can use scalp-directed devices in selected forms of hair loss. They do not prove that a whole-body wellness session treats every cause of thinning hair. Matrix’s ",
            "decorations": []
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Japanese head spa",
            "decorations": [
              {
                "type": "LINK",
                "linkData": {
                  "link": {
                    "url": "https://www.matrixmassage.net/japanese-head-spa-salem-wi",
                    "target": "SELF"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": " is a separate service experience, not a promise of hair regrowth.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s13",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n13",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "7. Can a wavelength tell me an exact treatment depth?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s14",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n14",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "A wavelength alone does not establish a universal depth of effective treatment. Avoid choosing a session on the basis of a simple claim that light reaches a certain number of centimeters into every person’s muscles, nerves or organs.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s15",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n15",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "8. Which other device details matter?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s16",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n16",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Output, exposure area, distance and time all affect how light is delivered. The equipment instructions and evidence for its use matter more than a list of wavelength numbers alone.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s17",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "HEADING",
      "id": "c07n17",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "9. How should I choose a session?",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "headingData": {
        "level": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s18",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07n18",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "type": "TEXT",
          "textData": {
            "text": "Explain your goals and relevant precautions. Do not apply a generic online distance or time chart to unfamiliar equipment. Medical symptoms and treatment decisions belong with your healthcare team.",
            "decorations": []
          }
        }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
    {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "id": "c07s19",
      "nodes": [],
      "paragraphData": {}
    },
